MANUAL selection-thesaurus-look: launch with COMPME_THESAURUS_SELECTION=1; select one word in TextEdit, confirm the correction banner, use Down to cycle, full-accept into the exact selected range, then move or collapse the stale selection and confirm it cannot apply

